OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground still 'like a building
OL,4,Asite' one year on
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have called for work to take
OL,7,Fplace on a playground in Derbyshire
OL,8,Fwhere broken equipment has been fenced
OL,9,Foff for more than a year.
OL,11,FThe play area at Alfreton Park opened
OL,12,Fin 2023, but Derbyshire County Council
OL,13,Finstalled metal fencing around some
OL,14,Fequipment in August last year as they
OL,15,Fwere deemed unsafe.
OL,17,FMum-of-two Paulina said it was "really
OL,18,Fdisappointing" the necessary work had
OL,19,Fnot yet been completed.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
