OL,3,GNEWSAPlayground still 'like a building
OL,4,Asite' one year on
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerbyshire County Council said two
OL,7,Fcompanies were costing up repairs and,
OL,8,Fonce completed, they would transfer the
OL,9,Fpark to Amber Valley Borough Council as
OL,10,Fpart of a wider project.
